<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Riksbank drains 36.5 bln SKR from market.</title>
<headline>Swedish Riksbank drains 36.5 bln SKR from market.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, on Tuesday drained 36.5 billion crowns from the market in its one-week reverse repurchase operation.</p>
<p>The reverse repo was set at an unchanged, fixed 4.35 percent and will run from December 4 to December 11, replacing an operation that drained 42 billion crowns from the market.</p>
<p>The Riksbank said 8.80 percent of bids for the tender were allocated.</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
